---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Breeds
description: The breeds registered by the Molosser International Association and their MIA breed standards.
lead: MIA breed standards are drafts until the family finalizes them.
---
<div class="card-grid">
  {%- for b in breeds %}
  <a class="breed-card" href="/breeds/{{ b.slug }}/">
    <img src="{{ b.image }}" alt="{{ b.imageAlt }}" style="object-position: {{ b.imagePosition }}" loading="lazy">
    <h3>{{ b.name }}</h3>
    <p>{{ b.blurb }}</p>
    <span>Read the standard &rarr;</span>
  </a>
  {%- endfor %}
</div>
